# Gnarlid Colony cast without kicker (CR 702.33a) enters as a bare 2/2 with no counter (CR 702.33d), so it has no trample itself;
# Bot1's Cloudbound Moogle puts a +1/+1 counter on Bot2's Ornithopter, which Colony's "creatures you control" (CR 613.1f)
# does not reach, so it stays a flyer without trample. (The control with the counter on Bot1's creature is
# gnarlid-colony-gives-trample-to-another-creature-you-control-with-a-counter.)

